PM 2.5 Prediction Model | Python
AI-powered system to predict PM2.5 air pollution using a fusion of MODIS AOD (satellite),
MERRA-2 (reanalysis), and OpenAQ (ground-based) data.
While this prototype uses New Delhi for demonstration, the ultimate goal is to scale it to a
grid-level prediction model for all of India.
